toolUseResult.newString:
/// <summary>
/// Builds the "Open in Browser" menu item for <paramref name="target"/> (a URL or a local file
/// path). A plain click reopens the remembered default, resolved as repository default -> global
/// default -> OS default. Hovering expands a submenu of "System default" plus each installed
/// browser with its real profiles (re-read from each browser's Local State so newly added
/// profiles appear without a restart). Each profile in turn offers three explicit choices - "Open
/// once" (remember nothing), "Set as default for this repository" (shown only for a session that
/// belongs to a repository), and "Set as application-wide default" - so the user says which
/// default, if any, a pick should set rather than silently overwriting the global one.
/// </summary>
